                {
                    "type": "Label",
                    "name": "TimetableHint",
                    "visible": false,
                    "caption": "The timetable appears on the overview: one bar per child with the school day, a marker for the current time and a switcher through the weekdays. The plan itself is kept in the timetable module — here you only decide which instances the interface shows. Two instances with the same children put every child in twice; for two views of ONE plan, give the second instance the first as its data source, then it does not appear here at all."
                },
                {
                    "type": "Label",
                    "caption": "Controls the tabs of this tile and of the SymDo web app. The favorites have no switch of their own any more — they belong to the shopping lists and open as a sheet from the heart in their header. The calendar tab additionally requires at least one configured OpenCalendar calendar, the notes tab and the AI inbox a SymDo Gateway. If all sections are switched off the overview is shown, so the interface is never empty. Only one section left: the tab bar disappears and the content gets the full height. The web app applies a change after a reload, the tile immediately."
                }
            ]
        },
